TI  - Assessment of Sludge Solubilization by Aeration and Zero-valent Iron As a Pre-treatment for Anaerobic Digestion
AU  - Kim, Yong-Jun
AU  - Park, Jin-Kyu
AU  - Tameda, Kazuo
AU  - Lee, Nam-Hoon
PY  - 2016
JO  - Journal of the Korea Organic Resource Recycling Association
VL  - 24
