TI  - Micro-Aerobic Pre-Treatment vs. Thermal Pre-Treatment of Waste Activated Sludge for Its Subsequent Anaerobic Digestion in Semi-Continuous Digesters: A Comparative Study
AU  - Castillo, Alejandra
AU  - Ortega-Martínez, Eduardo
